flowchart LR

A[God Creates Spirit<br/>Simple and Ignorant]
A --> B[Spirit World<br/>Freedom, preparation, first guidance]

B --> C[Earthly World<br/>Incarnation in dense matter]
C --> D[Earthly Life<br/>Choice, trial, expiation, service]
D --> E[Physical Death]
E --> F[Spirit World After Death<br/>Awakening, review, consequences, preparation]

F --> G{Enough moral progress<br/>for a higher world?}

G -->|No| H[Return to the same world<br/>or a similar world]
H --> C

G -->|Yes| I[More Advanced World<br/>Less material life, lighter trials]
I --> J[Life in that world<br/>Broader duties, clearer conscience]
J --> K[Death and Return to Spirit World]
K --> L[Spirit World After Higher Life<br/>Review and preparation]

L --> M{Pure spirit?}

M -->|No| N{Ready for an even<br/>more advanced world?}
N -->|No| I
N -->|Yes| O[Still Higher World]
O --> P[Further progress through life and return]
P --> L

M -->|Yes| Q[Pure Spirit / Angelic State]
Q --> R[No More Material Incarnations<br/>Free and active service under divine law]
